{"law":"苗栗縣-GL000203","name":"苗栗縣迅行及策略性更新地區建築物高度及建蔽率放寬標準","region":"苗栗縣","source":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContentHistoryList.aspx?id=GL000203","note":"歷次版本取自該縣市法規系統「歷史法規」；promulgated 是異動（發布）日期。施行日：自治法規依地方制度法第 32 條為發布日起算第三日，條文定有日期者依其日期；行政規則（要點、原則等）未明定者不推定（effectiveKnown=false）。無法切分條號的舊版只存 fullText。","currentPromulgated":null,"currentHash":"de475b8e8e99f7b3abd88baca397538596d3201d7e65d4ddf22aed20d4e224c9","texts":{"ac81c10557dc199c":"本標準依都市更新條例（以下簡稱本條例）第六十五條第四項規定訂定之\n\n。","52924b989b8feb40":"本標準之主管機關為苗栗縣政府。","16f87ed0e5a1987a":"本標準適用對象，指於本條例第七條或第八條所定迅行或策略性更新地區\n\n內實施之都市更新事業。","b8ecffcc0c5d860f":"更新單元放寬建蔽率以住宅區為限，且不得超過原建蔽率。\n\n依本標準放寬建蔽率之案件，仍應符合建築法令及都市計畫法令之退縮建\n\n築規定。","1aacbd2aa60b904a":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建築法令及\n\n都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","0760487a7e1a3f98":"本標準自發布日施行。"},"versions":[{"promulgated":null,"url":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000203","effective":null,"effectiveKnown":false,"effectiveBasis":"無發布日期","exceptions":{},"current":true,"changed":{"第 1 條":"ac81c10557dc199c","第 2 條":"52924b989b8feb40","第 3 條":"16f87ed0e5a1987a","第 4 條":"b8ecffcc0c5d860f","第 5 條":"1aacbd2aa60b904a","第 6 條":"0760487a7e1a3f98"},"removed":[],"articleOrder":["第 1 條","第 2 條","第 3 條","第 4 條","第 5 條","第 6 條"],"articleCount":6}],"articles":{"第 1 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"ac81c10557dc199c","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 2 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"52924b989b8feb40","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 3 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"16f87ed0e5a1987a","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 4 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"b8ecffcc0c5d860f","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 5 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"1aacbd2aa60b904a","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 6 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"0760487a7e1